errors.Unwrap of an errors.Join result is always nil at run time (Unwrap()
[]error is not consulted), so the precise set is empty. By design the call is
analysed without its operand: the same 2 unresolved(memory) entries as
unwrap_returned. doc.ErrEmpty and doc.ErrNoTitle must NOT appear.
